Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:41:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bootwait: logo row optically centred, then 20 px left (final
 layout)

Back to BW_LOGO=center (the tight_center preview the user liked) with a
new BW_LOGO_SHIFT (default -20): the logo row's left edge is x 211
instead of 231. Drops the "between" default.

